{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a life simulation game like Jones In The Fast Lane or No Time To Relax! The game has a gambling theme, it has a three player human mode, and a single player human vs computer, it has a robbery option when you buy a gun, and possible jail if you get busted, and a roll of the dice to get out of jail! I have a casino and the ability to rob stores to get money, I have a hostage situation in my game so players can take a business hostage so they can get money where you can request a helicopter or a get away car to get away with the money, in my game you must reach 2M dollars and have full education complete to win, I have slot machines in the casino and 21 black jack! In my game players can choose 1 player vs 2 player or play by yourself mode! Players can play against the computer or play a three player human mode with friends! I have a jobs and education, and buying items for the home, players must eat each turn or you will die, but in play by yourself mode player does not die from hunger! My game is different from No Time To Relax or Jones In The Fast Lane, because I have included many of the other games themes, but my game has many new added features! Players must pay rent, and work towards the 2M dollar goal, and full education complete! If user chooses to play by himself it's a good way to have fun with free play without the hunger penalty!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002050?t=1759624659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002050/3c041a50efc942c427df5ba3b6b8b0af966c4755/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759624659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002050/23efc38791abee143974f5bb9574b4257029b9e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759624659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002050/23efc38791abee143974f5bb9574b4257029b9e6/capsule_1